            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-timeline">

            <div class="process-step">
                <div class="process-icon"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-list"></i></div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h3>Submit a Donation</h3>
                    <p>The donor enters details of the surplus food — type, quantity, and pickup location.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="process-step">
                <div class="process-icon"><i class="fas fa-search"></i></div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h3>Admin Reviews the Request</h3>
                    <p>The admin checks the donation details and looks for an available agent nearby.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="process-step">
                <div class="process-icon"><i class="fas fa-user-check"></i></div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h3>Agent Assigned &amp; Pickup</h3>
                    <p>The nearest agent is assigned to the request and collects the food from the donor.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="process-step">
                <div class="process-icon"><i class="fas fa-flag-checkered"></i></div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h3>Delivered &amp; Confirmed</h3>
                    <p>The food is delivered to the recipient and the donation is marked complete.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

